---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="PurrSafe privacy notice">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-block: 4rem">
    <a href="/">← Back to PurrSafe</a>
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>For the private beta, we use your email to manage invitations and send the confirmation message you request. Beta consent is required.</p>
    <p>We do not sell your email. You can unsubscribe from invitation emails at any time by using the link in the message.</p>
    <p>On the landing page we also count how many people reach the signup form. Three things are counted: the page being opened, a click on a button that jumps to the form, and the first time someone starts filling it in. Each count records only which of those three happened — no email address, no identifier, no cookie — so the totals cannot be traced back to you or followed across other sites.</p>
    <p>This beta notice is a plain-language summary. Final legal contact details will be added before public launch.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
